# Secrets the monitoring stack reads from docker/secrets/ (backlog #0-16):
# the platform-operator tenant's Integration API key and the dead man's
# switch URL. Never commit to git. The whole directory's contents are
# ignored, not one filename, so any secret written there is covered.
docker/secrets/*
!docker/secrets/.gitkeep
